# Working design notes. Drafts, not documentation: they name unreleased
# features, quote real tokens, and go stale the moment the code lands. This
# rule only stops NEW files here from being added: the four older plans and
# specs were already tracked and stay tracked, because a gitignore entry has
# no effect on a file git already knows about. Do not git rm them to "apply"
# this rule, that just deletes public project history.
docs/superpowers/

# Real PostHog project token. The committed TelemetryToken.cs placeholder
